{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1275.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1cfb8d06f419ccb3670e9277862504252f9a76e8b1ef732a3ac925a4be584a0c","ja":"ナイトプールに来ると、やっぱりドキドキしちゃうわ。\nうふふ。とっても楽しいライブだったわね♪","zh":"来到夜间泳池，果然还是会心跳加速呢。\n呵呵。真是场非常开心的演出呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1275.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"39bdf53a0a2b10ee20c243ce1f524977783e59396e38218a684e25849f1bb1e4","ja":"きらびやかな非日常空間の舞台……\n真、素晴らしい一夜だったかと。","zh":"华丽而超脱日常的舞台空间……\n想必真的是度过了一个美妙的夜晚吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1275.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"97b575a64652bd63683e98e9293c35a1a31d87bced360bcb1eea45d9e58dbe67","ja":"ふふ……あら、プールのオーナーさん！\n本日は大変お世話に……えっ？","zh":"呵呵……哎呀，游泳池的老板！\n今天承蒙您多方关照……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1275.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"70900307d2ee630b1d55e766a620d95c56936821887ca9b7b125872f56b8659e","ja":"いえ、お礼など。私達もこちらの\nぷーるがさらに盛り上がれば、なおのこと嬉しく……。","zh":"哪里的话，不用言谢。要是这边的\n泳池能变得更加热闹，我们也会更加高兴的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1275.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f536d4714082a76381331270586ef946a510b609be1fa8703329307d7eaec3b9","ja":"はい。ですから本当に、お気持ちだけで……\nえっ……どうしても、ですか？　ええと……。","zh":"好的。所以真的只要有这份心意就……\n诶……无论如何都想给吗？那个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1275.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"7be50b96896544810f86694ef98b6ff63e0c259a9fdaba8efa79923161475072","ja":"私たち5人を系列のホテルにご招待……\n好きなだけ泊ってくださいって……いいんですか！？","zh":"招待我们5个人去旗下的酒店……\n还说想住多久就住多久……真的可以吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
